  "summary": "The netlist shows the servo signal outputs permanently joined by a 0 Ω link, contrary to the intended independent PWM channels and selectable serial-mode bridge. It also shows both alternate GPIO mapping paths populated, tying together bus pins intended to be selected by Core variant."
